    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816400/extras/c465db1f1996f15ea25eb1325235e170.avif?t=1754586963\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Super Carpark Walking Parking Simulator Turbo</strong></i></u> (working name)<br>is <i><strong>the</strong></i> definitive animated carpark  chaotic parking simulator!!!<br><br>The carpark has become sentient and gone for a walk! All the cars inside are falling out and its your job to park them in parking spaces before they get tickets.<br><br>Click and drag the cars to draw out paths to the parking spaces. The longer the path the higher the score.<br><br>Demo coming soon! <u><strong>Follow</strong></u> to get notified via a blog post! We are committed to finishing this game but just how big and complex it gets is up to you!\u00a0  <br><br>The more <strong><i><u>wishlists</u></i></strong>\u00a0Super Carpark Walking Parking Simulator Turbo receives the more roadmap features we'll implement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Roadmap;</i></strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leader board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo/score multiplier system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Deck building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time of day system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game-mode, multiplayer parking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game-mode, multiplayer soccer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game-mode, multiplayer cops &amp; robbers. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816400/extras/e3c7a2aa4e85e5cd9d493dc0f78d0aa0.avif?t=1754586963\" width=173 height=217 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816400/extras/c465db1f1996f15ea25eb1325235e170.avif?t=1754586963\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Super Carpark Walking Parking Simulator Turbo</strong></i></u> (working name)<br>is <i><strong>the</strong></i> definitive animated carpark  chaotic parking simulator!!!<br><br>The carpark has become sentient and gone for a walk! All the cars inside are falling out and its your job to park them in parking spaces before they get tickets.<br><br>Click and drag the cars to draw out paths to the parking spaces. The longer the path the higher the score.<br><br>Demo coming soon! <u><strong>Follow</strong></u> to get notified via a blog post! We are committed to finishing this game but just how big and complex it gets is up to you!\u00a0  <br><br>The more <strong><i><u>wishlists</u></i></strong>\u00a0Super Carpark Walking Parking Simulator Turbo receives the more roadmap features we'll implement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Roadmap;</i></strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leader board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickups.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different cars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combo/score multiplier system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Deck building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time of day system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story cutscenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game-mode, multiplayer parking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game-mode, multiplayer soccer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New game-mode, multiplayer cops &amp; robbers. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816400/extras/e3c7a2aa4e85e5cd9d493dc0f78d0aa0.avif?t=1754586963\" width=173 height=217 /></span></p></li></ul>",
